  "release": {
    "kind": "release",
    "notes": "Independent representation of the Opus 5.5 planner's revised ontology. Content only: no agents, connector, launcher or live state. Every observation is a dated capture; proposed interactions are marked as proposed. Version 2: notes live in the collection's notes folder and link to each other as siblings, so links survive import. Version 3: a second snapshot, Current table account, and instructions that save and restore named snapshots, since a restore cannot be undone."
